<title>HONG KONG: Merrill Lynch sets call warrants on HSBC.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets call warrants on HSBC.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch International &amp; Co C.V. said on Friday it has issued 100 million American-style call warrants on shares of HSBC Holdings Plc.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    HK$200	   PREMIUM	    18.4 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     HK$1.25	  GEARING	    14.4X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	30.OCT.97	SETTLEMENT DATE  04.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   HONG KONG	LISTING DATE     05.MAR.97</p>
<p> REFERENCE PRICE HK$179.50	MIN EXER LOT     4,000</p>
<p> NOTES	     PHYSICAL SETTLEMENT ONLY</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
